Scope

The MIT license above covers this repository's own work: the boot shim
(shim/), the tools (tools/), the phone-side programs (phone/, including
SweetAudio.driver), the CI workflows and the documentation.

It does not change the license of code this project modifies or stages:

- xnu/patches/: patches to Apple's XNU kernel. XNU is licensed under the
  Apple Public Source License 2.0 (APSL 2.0); the patches, and the files they
  add to the XNU tree, are distributed under the APSL 2.0 as well. The same
  applies to the staged Apple open-source components (libpthread, HFS).
- phone/turnip/: patches to Mesa, which keep Mesa's licenses (MIT).
- Other third-party code keeps the license stated in its own files.

No Apple software (IPSW contents, firmware, frameworks) is part of this
repository, and none is covered by this license.
